    "html": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --color-neon-glow: #34d59a;\n    --color-whiteout: #ffffff;\n    --color-blackout: #000000;\n    --color-graphite-deep: #151617;\n    --color-graphite-light: #303236;\n    --color-ash: #797d86;\n    --font-inter: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    --font-geistmono: 'Fira Code', 'Source Code Pro', monospace;\n  }\n\n  .cta-wrapper {\n    background: var(--color-blackout);\n    padding: 64px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    max-width: 600px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .cta-eyebrow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-family: var(--font-geistmono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .cta-eyebrow-icon {\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    border-top: 5px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 5px solid transparent;\n    border-left: 8px solid #ff3621;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n\n  .cta-headline {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 48px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.13;\n    letter-spacing: -1.2px;\n    color: var(--color-whiteout);\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n\n  .cta-subtext {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    letter-spacing: -0.43px;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin: 0 0 28px 0;\n    max-width: 440px;\n  }\n\n  .cta-buttons {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .btn-primary {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-graphite-deep);\n    background: var(--color-whiteout);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    padding: 12px 28px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .btn-primary:hover {\n    opacity: 0.88;\n  }\n\n  .btn-ghost {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-whiteout);\n    background: transparent;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-graphite-light);\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .btn-ghost:hover {\n    border-color: var(--color-ash);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"cta-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"cta-eyebrow\">\n    <span class=\"cta-eyebrow-icon\"></span>\n    Agent Platform\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"cta-headline\">Fast Postgres<br>for Teams and Agents</h2>\n  <p class=\"cta-subtext\">Codegen and agent platforms rely on Neon to run the backend for user-generated apps.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-buttons\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">Get started</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-ghost\">Read the docs</a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "CTA Button Group",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --color-neon-glow: #34d59a;\n    --color-neon-muted: #285d49;\n    --color-whiteout: #ffffff;\n    --color-blackout: #000000;\n    --color-graphite-deep: #151617;\n    --color-graphite: #242628;\n    --color-graphite-light: #303236;\n    --color-ash: #797d86;\n    --color-cloud: #c9cbcf;\n    --font-inter: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    --font-geistmono: 'Fira Code', 'Source Code Pro', monospace;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-wrapper {\n    background: var(--color-blackout);\n    padding: 40px 32px;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-label {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-block {\n    background: var(--color-graphite-deep);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-graphite-light);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-titlebar {\n    background: var(--color-graphite);\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 7px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-graphite-light);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-dot {\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--color-graphite-light);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-body {\n    padding: 20px 20px 24px;\n    font-family: var(--font-geistmono);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-prompt {\n    color: var(--color-cloud);\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-prompt .dollar {\n    color: var(--color-neon-glow);\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-output-title {\n    color: var(--color-cloud);\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-step {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 10px;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-step-indicator {\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    background: var(--color-graphite-light);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-step-indicator.active {\n    background: var(--color-neon-glow);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-step.completed {\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-step.in-progress {\n    color: var(--color-cloud);\n  }\n\n  .step-text strong {\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--color-cloud);\n  }\n\n  .step-text.neon strong {\n    color: var(--color-neon-glow);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-divider {\n    height: 1px;\n    background: var(--color-graphite-light);\n    margin: 14px 0;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-stat {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0;\n    font-family: var(--font-geistmono);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-stat .stat-label {\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n  }\n\n  .terminal-stat .stat-value {\n    color: var(--color-neon-glow);\n    margin-left: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .terminal-stat .stat-separator {\n    color: var(--color-graphite-light);\n    margin: 0 12px;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"terminal-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"terminal-label\">Neon Project Initialization</div>\n  <div class=\"terminal-block\">\n    <div class=\"terminal-titlebar\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-dot\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n      <span class=\"terminal-prompt\">\n        <span class=\"dollar\">$</span>npx neonctl init\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"terminal-output-title\">Neon Project Initialization</span>\n      <div class=\"terminal-step completed\">\n        <div class=\"terminal-step-indicator\"></div>\n        <span class=\"step-text\">Step 1/3: <strong>Configuring Neon MCP Server...</strong></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-step completed\">\n        <div class=\"terminal-step-indicator\"></div>\n        <span class=\"step-text\">Step 2/3: <strong>Creating neon.md with detailed guidelines...</strong></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-step in-progress\">\n        <div class=\"terminal-step-indicator active\"></div>\n        <span class=\"step-text neon\">Step 3/3: <strong>Creating AGENTS.md</strong></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-divider\"></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-stat\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Databases deployed:</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">37,005</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-separator\">|</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Active:</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">16,561</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-separator\">|</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Idle: 1,942</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Terminal Code Block",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --color-neon-glow: #34d59a;\n    --color-whiteout: #ffffff;\n    --color-blackout: #000000;\n    --color-graphite-deep: #151617;\n    --color-graphite: #242628;\n    --color-graphite-light: #303236;\n    --color-ash: #797d86;\n    --color-cloud: #c9cbcf;\n    --font-inter: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    --font-geistmono: 'Fira Code', 'Source Code Pro', monospace;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-wrapper {\n    background: var(--color-blackout);\n    padding: 48px 32px;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-kicker {\n    font-family: var(--font-geistmono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-headline {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    letter-spacing: -0.64px;\n    color: var(--color-whiteout);\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-sub {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    letter-spacing: -0.64px;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-divider {\n    height: 1px;\n    background: var(--color-graphite-light);\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-graphite-light);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: all 0.15s ease;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-item.active .feature-dot {\n    background: var(--color-neon-glow);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(52, 213, 154, 0.5);\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-item.active .feature-item-label {\n    color: var(--color-whiteout);\n  }\n\n  .feature-dot {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--color-graphite-light);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    transition: background 0.15s ease;\n  }\n\n  .feature-item-label {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n    transition: color 0.15s ease;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .feature-item-arrow {\n    color: var(--color-graphite-light);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-item.active .feature-item-arrow {\n    opacity: 1;\n    color: var(--color-neon-glow);\n  }\n\n  .feature-active-bar {\n    width: 3px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: var(--color-neon-glow);\n    border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .feature-nav-item {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .feature-pill {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    background: rgba(52, 213, 154, 0.08);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(52, 213, 154, 0.2);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    font-family: var(--font-geistmono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--color-neon-glow);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    margin-left: auto;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"feature-nav-wrapper\">\n  <span class=\"feature-nav-kicker\">\u25cf AI</span>\n  <h2 class=\"feature-nav-headline\">Postgres for the AI Engineering era.</h2>\n  <p class=\"feature-nav-sub\">Integrate with a single command and the LLM does the hard work.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"feature-nav-divider\"></div>\n\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"feature-nav-item active\">\n    <span class=\"feature-dot\"></span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-label\">Advanced Autoscaling</span>\n    <span class=\"feature-pill\">New</span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-arrow\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <path d=\"M3 7H11M11 7L7.5 3.5M11 7L7.5 10.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"feature-nav-item\">\n    <span class=\"feature-dot\"></span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-label\">Instant Branching</span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-arrow\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <path d=\"M3 7H11M11 7L7.5 3.5M11 7L7.5 10.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"feature-nav-item\">\n    <span class=\"feature-dot\"></span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-label\">Auth Included</span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-arrow\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <path d=\"M3 7H11M11 7L7.5 3.5M11 7L7.5 10.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"feature-nav-item\">\n    <span class=\"feature-dot\"></span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-label\">Production-Grade Features</span>\n    <span class=\"feature-item-arrow\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <path d=\"M3 7H11M11 7L7.5 3.5M11 7L7.5 10.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n</div>",
    "name": "Feature Navigation List",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
